      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey Voxian! We reviewed your avatar and found the issue is caused by exceeding the constraint limits. In its current state it has 190 constraints, which goes over the 150 limit for mobile platforms. The version you shared without wings works because it reduces the number of constraints to below the limit. So you will need to reduce the constraints to meet this target for the avatar to work as expected on Android. \n\nWe recommend checking out the mobile limits documentation (https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system/#mobile-avatar-component-limits) for validating an avatar before publishing to those platforms.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
