      "value": "@{68c9c6e2004e872823bb7e44|full_name}\n\nOh! I didn't realize that was a hard limit... I thought it would still be able to load it but just mark it as Very Poor.\n\nThank you for clarifying... unfortunately I don't have a solution for reducing the constraints by 40, but I'll pass this information along to my customers.",
