      "value": "@{5dbb0a6b74589a45d1477065|full_name} Ah sorry to hear removing the 40 isn't an option. The key info there is \"If a mobile avatar exceeds a limit, all limited avatar components are removed from the avatar\" -- so after 150, any further constraints are entirely removed. Hard limit indeed I'm afraid, at least for the time being on mobile platforms.",
