  "details": "On the 4paw avatar base that I made, the Android version does not play many of the animations correctly. This same upload works correctly on PC and in the editor with an emulator.\n\nI am unsure how to troubleshoot this issue, so I am asking for help.\n\nThis is an example public ID that is not working correctly.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_89d7232f-982b-4827-badd-abc235efb349\n\nWhen I remove the wings and only have the body, it does work correctly, as demonstrated in this public ID.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_83db4333-370a-4167-b8b2-1b41cf6a1be6",
